# A receiver's acknowledgements, by why Linux sends them (pcap.py acks):
# the seed sends two links 64 KiB every 250 ms in 4 KiB writes (two full
# packets and a short one each), half a period apart; link 1's reverse
# path is quiet, link 2's carries a 40-byte write every 15 ms, as a
# viewer's HAVEs would.
# env: VIEWERS=2 SEED_UP_MBIT=10 SECS=30 PCAP=1
burst 0 1 0 250 65536 4096
burst 0 2 125 250 65536 4096
burst 2 0 5 15 40 40
